@ Start

? if: {melodia_solstice_granted} == on

  - Solstice Singer
    The drum remembers the beat you kept. Carry it back to the grove when you are ready.

? else:

  ? if: {melodia_q_echo_02_complete} == on

    - Solstice Singer
      You taught the echo to listen, not to vanish. That is the measure the solstice honors.

    - Solstice Singer
      Take the drum. It will hold your tempo steady when the path ahead grows loud.

    $ melodia_solstice_granted = on
    $ Notify melodia:reward:melodia_reward_solstice_drum
    $ Notify melodia:stat:reunion_solstice:melodia_harmony:1

  ? else:

    - Solstice Singer
      The solstice hums softly. Come back when the grove's echo has been answered.

  ? endif

? endif

$ End
